ication of the Nomination file, including the maps and names, does not imply the expression of any opinion whatsoever of the World Heritage Committee or of the Secretariat of UNESCO concerning the history or legal status of any country, territory, city or area or of its boundaries.\nL154: The georeferenced polygons for this property will be made available once the GIS data will be received by UNESCO. To experience the potential of GIS data, please visit the cite25†UNESCO Sites Navigator .\nL155: ##### State of Conservation (SOC)\nL156: \nL157: by year\nL158: \nL159: cite26†2025 cite27†2023 cite28†2021 cite29†2002 cite30†2001 cite31†2000 cite32†1999 cite33†1997 cite34†1996 cite35†1995 L160: ##### Protections\nL161: by other conservation instruments\nL162: \nL163: 1 protection / 1 element\nL164: \nL165: Biosphere Reserves (1 element)\nL166: \nL167:   * cite36†Komodo†www.unesco.org L168: \nL169: cite37†Read more about synergies L170: \nL171: cite38†Image: logo L172: \nL173: cite39†Committee sessions cite40†Statutory Documents cite41†Committee decisions cite42†48^{th} session (2026) cite43†47^{th} session (2025) L174: \nL175: cite44†General Assembly cite45†26^{th} GA (2027) cite46†25^{th} GA (2025) L176: cite47†About World Heritage cite48†The Convention cite49†Convention Text cite50†Policy Compendium cite51†Declaration of principles cite52†Operational Guidelines cite53†The Emblem cite54†The States Parties cite55†The Advisory Bodies cite56†The Centre cite57†Employment & Internships cite58†Who's Who L177: \nL178: cite59†The List cite59†World Heritage List cite60†World Heritage in Danger cite61†New Inscriptions cite23†Criteria for Selection cite62†Tentative Lists cite63†World Heritage List Nominations L179: cite64†Reporting & Monitoring cite65†State of Conservation (SOC) cite66†Periodic Reporting cite67†Questionnaires 2018-2024 cite68†Que